#: ../../book/comparison.rst:99
msgid ""
"**Path C: Standard Two-Stage Restricted Technology Export License (** "
"``技术出口许可证`` **):**"
msgstr " **경로 C: 표준 2단계 수출 제한 기술 수출 허가증 (**  ``技术出口许可证``  **):** "

#: ../../book/comparison.rst:101
msgid ""
"**Stage 1: Before substantive negotiation or signing a contract (up to 30 "
"working days):** File the *Application for Chinese Restricted Export "
"Technology* (``中国限制出口技术申请书``) with your **Provincial Commerce Department** "
"(``省、自治区、直辖市商务主管部门``) `CNMEAS, Arts. 4-5 "
"<https://www.mofcom.gov.cn/dl/file/20211203230621.pdf>`_. Within **5 working"
" days**, Provincial Commerce forwards technical materials to the "
"**Provincial Science & Technology Department** (``省、自治区、直辖市科技行政主管部门``), "
"which convenes experts to complete technical review within **15 working "
"days** `CNMEAS, Art. 7 "
"<https://www.mofcom.gov.cn/dl/file/20211203230621.pdf>`_. Within **30 "
"working days total** from receipt, the authorities decide and, if approved, "
"issue the **Letter of Intent for Technology Export License** "
"(``中华人民共和国技术出口许可意向书``), valid for **up to 3 years** `CNTIER, Arts. 35-36 "
"<https://xzfg.moj.gov.cn/front/law/detail?LawID=898>`_ `CNMEAS, Arts. 6, 10 "
"<https://www.mofcom.gov.cn/dl/file/20211203230621.pdf>`_. *(Statutory rule: "
"without holding this Letter of Intent, no entity or individual may conduct "
"substantive export negotiations or make legally binding commitments `CNMEAS,"
" Art. 11 <https://www.mofcom.gov.cn/dl/file/20211203230621.pdf>`_.)*"
msgstr ""
" **1단계: 실질적 협상 개시 또는 계약 체결 전 (최대 30영업일):**  소재지  **성급 상무 주관부서** \\ "
"(``省、自治区、直辖市商务主管部门``)에 《중국 수출제한 기술 신청서》(``中国限制出口技术申请书``)를 제출한다 `CNMEAS, "
"Arts. 4-5 <https://www.mofcom.gov.cn/dl/file/20211203230621.pdf>`_. 성급 상무청은"
"  **5영업일**  이내에 기술 자료를  **성급 과학기술 행정부서** \\ (``省、自治区、直辖市科技行政主管部门``)로 이첩하며, "
"과학기술청은 전문가를 소집해  **15영업일**  이내에 기술 심사를 마친다 `CNMEAS, Art. 7 "
"<https://www.mofcom.gov.cn/dl/file/20211203230621.pdf>`_. 접수일로부터  **총 "
"30영업일**  이내에 당국이 승인 여부를 결정하며, 승인 시  **최대 3년**  동안 유효한  **기술수출 허가의향서** \\ "
"(``中华人民共和国技术出口许可意向书``)를 발급한다 `CNTIER, Arts. 35-36 "
"<https://xzfg.moj.gov.cn/front/law/detail?LawID=898>`_ `CNMEAS, Arts. 6, 10 "
"<https://www.mofcom.gov.cn/dl/file/20211203230621.pdf>`_.  *(법정 의무 규정: 이 "
"허가의향서를 취득하지 않은 상태에서는 그 어떤 기관이나 개인도 실질적인 수출 협상을 진행하거나 법적 구속력이 있는 약정을 맺을 수 없다 "
"`CNMEAS, Art. 11 <https://www.mofcom.gov.cn/dl/file/20211203230621.pdf>`_.)*"
" "

#: ../../book/comparison.rst:102
msgid ""
"**Stage 2: After signing the contract (up to 15 working days):** Sign the "
"contract, log contract details in the online system, and submit to "
"Provincial Commerce: **(i)** Letter of Intent, **(ii)** signed contract "
"copy, **(iii)** Technical Documentation Export Checklist (``技术资料出口清单``), and"
" **(iv)** legal-status proofs of both contracting parties `CNTIER, Art. 37 "
"<https://xzfg.moj.gov.cn/front/law/detail?LawID=898>`_ `CNMEAS, Arts. 13, 16"
" <https://www.mofcom.gov.cn/dl/file/20211203230621.pdf>`_. Provincial "
"Commerce reviews contract authenticity and decides within **15 working "
"days**, issuing the formal **Technology Export License** "
"(``中华人民共和国技术出口许可证``) `CNTIER, Arts. 37-38 "
"<https://xzfg.moj.gov.cn/front/law/detail?LawID=898>`_ `CNMEAS, Art. 14 "
"<https://www.mofcom.gov.cn/dl/file/20211203230621.pdf>`_. **Crucial "
"statutory rule:** A restricted technology export contract *takes legal "
"effect only on the date the Technology Export License is issued*, and the "
"exporter presents that license to clear **customs, foreign exchange, "
"banking, and tax** procedures `CNTIER, Art. 38 "
"<https://xzfg.moj.gov.cn/front/law/detail?LawID=898>`_ `CNMEAS, Arts. 15, 18"
" <https://www.mofcom.gov.cn/dl/file/20211203230621.pdf>`_ `CNQA "
"<https://www.mofcom.gov.cn/zwgk/zcjd/art/2026/art_b11d5c1e9374421e93e85dc87eba6e38.html>`_."
msgstr ""
" **2단계: 계약 체결 후 본허가 (최대 15영업일):**  계약을 체결한 뒤 온라인 시스템에 계약 정보를 등록하고, 성급 상무청에  "
"**(i)**  기술수출 허가의향서,  **(ii)**  서명된 계약서 사본,  **(iii)**  기술자료 수출 "
"목록(``技术资料出口清单``),  **(iv)**  계약 양 당사자의 법적 지위 증명 서류를 제출한다 `CNTIER, Art. 37 "
"<https://xzfg.moj.gov.cn/front/law/detail?LawID=898>`_ `CNMEAS, Arts. 13, 16"
" <https://www.mofcom.gov.cn/dl/file/20211203230621.pdf>`_. 성급 상무청은 계약의 진위 "
"여부를 심사하여  **15영업일**  이내에 결정하고 정식  **기술수출허가증** \\ (``中华人民共和国技术出口许可证``)을 발급한다 "
"`CNTIER, Arts. 37-38 <https://xzfg.moj.gov.cn/front/law/detail?LawID=898>`_ "
"`CNMEAS, Art. 14 <https://www.mofcom.gov.cn/dl/file/20211203230621.pdf>`_.  "
"**핵심 법정 원칙:**  수출 제한 기술의 수출 계약은  *기술수출허가증이 발급된 날로부터 비로소 법적 효력이 발생* \\ 하며, "
"수출자는 이 허가증을 제시해야만  **세관 통관, 외환, 은행 결제 및 세무**  절차를 처리할 수 있다 `CNTIER, Art. 38 "
"<https://xzfg.moj.gov.cn/front/law/detail?LawID=898>`_ `CNMEAS, Arts. 15, 18"
" <https://www.mofcom.gov.cn/dl/file/20211203230621.pdf>`_ `CNQA "
"<https://www.mofcom.gov.cn/zwgk/zcjd/art/2026/art_b11d5c1e9374421e93e85dc87eba6e38.html>`_."

